      "writtenOn": "2022-11-17T21:42:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not concerned about missing this internally.  However, if I were a client, I would rather see an outright failure so I would know that the ops should get implemented. This risk-averse approach reduces the odds of someone dropping the ball before you commercialize something.",
      "parentUuid": "ba58e162_a40d8fee",
